{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"846","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"武漢肺炎》泰國禁塑破功 4月塑膠汙染量暴增","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E6%B3%B0%E5%9C%8B%E5%A1%91%E8%86%A0(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">泰國因武漢肺炎導致的封鎖政策，使民眾外帶、外送的頻率大幅增加，塑膠垃圾量在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月份猛增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">62%</span>。圖為泰國外送示意圖。（路透檔案照）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">2020-05-11 22:55:15</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">〔即時新聞／綜合報導〕泰國今年（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>）初開始禁止大型商店使用一次性塑膠袋，並希望在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2021</span>年時達到完全禁用塑膠袋的目標。但泰國政府官方數據顯示，因武漢肺炎（新型冠狀病毒疾病，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">COVID-19</span>）疫情導致的封鎖政策，使民眾外帶、外送的頻率大幅增加，因此塑膠垃圾數量不但未減少，甚至在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月份猛增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">62%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">《曼谷郵報》 報導，由於停班停課，外帶、外送的比率升高，民眾尼嘉（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Nicha</span>）提到，網購會有許多防撞泡泡紙和外包裝，高頻率地叫外送則使家中堆積許多塑膠袋和塑膠容器。數據指出，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月份光是首都曼谷丟棄的塑膠廢物就高達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3432</span>噸，遠高於去年平均的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2115</span>噸，其中外帶的容器佔<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">80%</span>以上。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">泰國環境研究所（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">TEI</span>）所長威扎警告：「塑膠廢料的大幅增長令人擔憂」，並補充通常泰國每年產生約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">200</span>萬噸的塑膠垃圾，「但今年可能再增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30%</span>」。國家資源及環境部長瓦拉沃特（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Varawut Silpa-archa</span>）坦承目前在「減塑」上正遭遇挫折，但他仍認為「不要一次打很多仗」，當務之急是控制武肺疫情。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">美國海洋保育協會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Ocean Conservancy</span>）說，東南亞地區某些國家長期以來不斷將塑料廢物流至海洋；協會副總裁塞斯（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Doug Cress</span>）表示，此次疫情之後，必定會對海洋造成更大的衝擊。其他海洋塑膠汙染最嚴重的幾個國家如中國、印尼、菲律賓和越南，都未提供相關數據。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://news.ltn.com.tw/news/world/breakingnews/3162222</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-05-12","clk_count":"129"}},"__N_SSG":true}